## 3️⃣ Interface Contracts, State Transitions & Invariants  

### 3.1 Repository Port (Persistence Boundary)

```ts
// src/application/ports/IOrderRepository.ts
import { Order, OrderId } from '../../domain/entities/Order';
import { OrderReadyInfo } from '../../domain/value-objects/OrderReadyInfo';

